  calculator: 'M6 3.5h12a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v14a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H6A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 19V5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6 3.5zM7.5 7.5h9M7.5 11.5h.01M12 11.5h.01M16.5 11.5h.01M7.5 15.5h.01M12 15.5h.01M16.5 15.5h.01',
